        <item>
            <title>2.18.0</title>
            <pubDate>Wed, 19 Aug 2026 17:20:03 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>93</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.18.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features

- **Rename a session by hand.** Right-click its row in the sidebar, or double-click a pane header. The name you type sticks — automatic titling never overwrites it, and it survives a relaunch.

### Changes

- **Session titles are generated outside the session now.** An output style or persona configured in your Claude settings no longer ends up in the title.
- **A title keeps improving as the conversation develops** instead of being fixed by its first message. A short opening like "hi" no longer produces a title at all — your own words are shown until there is enough to describe.
- **Conversation text sent to the title generator no longer travels on the command line**, where any other process running as you could have read it out of the process table.
]]></description>
